the fabric. The steps are as follows:\\n\\n1. Lay the quilt on a flat surface.\\n2. Fold the lower right corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n3. Fold the lower left corner up towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n4. Fold the top left corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n5. Fold the top right corner down towards the center of the quilt, making sure the fold is on the bias.\\n\\nTherefore, based on Passage 2, you should fold a quilt by laying it flat and folding it in thirds along the bias of the fabric.\\n\\nPassage 3 does not provide instructions for folding a quilt.\\n\\nIn conclusion, based on the provided passages, the steps for folding a quilt are:\\n\\n1. Lay the quilt flat.\\n2. Fold the quilt in thirds along the bias of the fabric.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n", "add_special": true}
