hef doesn't need to be micromanaged like that.\\\\\\\" And that, my Yelp friends, was my limit to the abuse I was going to take from this witch of a waitress.\\\\n\\\\nI smiled and said thank you, but we aren't going to stay. She said okay, opened the door, walked into the restaurant, and I could hear her behind me exclaiming with a groan as she entered, \\\\\\\"Oh my Gaaaaawwwdd.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nGood thing they're in a tourist zone, because Petit Valentien can have a fresh supply of customers the waitress can abuse. As for this local, I'd recommend one of our other many fine dining establishments and give this one a wide berth, if service is important to you.\\\\n\\\\nTwo last comments: First, we noticed the restaurant had a Help Wanted sign posted, looking for servers, which could hint that maybe the attitude starts at the top and they have a hard time keeping servers. Second, I noticed another one of the local Yelp Elite crew (and other reviewers) also commented on the rude and inattentive service here. Seems to be a trend and unfortunately, it was our unlucky turn to experience it tonight.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-08 16:53:58\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Just don't go. They are severely understaffed and incredibly rude. We had to walk out after the waitress ignored us for about 15-20 minutes. We had to ask her three times to let us know what the wait time would be. Very unprofessional.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-10-02 22:38:26\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Amazing experience with a variety of Ethiopian flavors giving it the right touch. A story in flavors you need to experience. Lovely location feels like your in another world.  \\\\nGreat service.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data in JSON format, Petit Valentien is a French and Ethiopian restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA. The restaurant has a 4-star rating and offers services 