0.20.187.919 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"\", \"original_answer\": \"Based on the provided structured data, Soho Restaurant & Music Club is a popular local spot in Santa Barbara that offers a variety of experiences, including live music performances, dining, and drinks. According to customer reviews, the restaurant serves American-style cuisine, including burgers and pasta, and has a full bar with a selection of cocktails. One reviewer mentions that the food is delicious and compares the restaurant favorably to other local establishments.\\n\\nThe venue also hosts live music events, which appear to be well-received by customers. One reviewer praises the sound quality during a performance by Chris Schiflett, indicating that the venue has made significant improvements in recent years. Additionally, customers appreciate the modern and clean bathrooms, which suggests that the venue prioritizes comfort and hygiene.\\n\\nHowever, there are some drawbacks noted in the reviews. One reviewer expresses disappointment with the venue's no-refund policy for tickets, even in the case of a positive COVID test result. Another reviewer had a negative experience with staff behavior, reporting that they were called \\\"idiots\\\" by a staff member.\\n\\nOverall, Soho Restaurant & Music Club appears to be a lively and enjoyable spot in Santa Barbara, offering a range of experiences for locals and visitors alike. While there may be some areas for improvement in terms of customer service and ticket policies, the venue generally receives high marks from customers for its food, drinks, and live music performances.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [], \"source_evidence_erased\": true}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
