ily was on vacation in the Bahamas in 2009. \\\"Oh, my God, I wouldn't have made it,\\\" said Travolta, whose wife, Kelly Preston, is also a member. \\\"Honestly.\\\"\\n\", \"original_answer\": \"HBO's documentary \\\"Going Clear: Scientology and the Prison of Belief\\\" has received buzz, but John Travolta, a high-profile Scientologist, is not interested in seeing it. Travolta believes the documentary is based on \\\"disgruntled\\\" individuals and that he has had positive experiences with the Church of Scientology. He calls Scientology \\\"brilliant\\\" and credits the church with helping him cope with the death of his son.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
