cant impact on the country genre. Overall, the 50th ACM Awards had its ups and downs, but it was a memorable and significant milestone for the country music community.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [], \"source_evidence_erased\": true}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n"}
