T so blessed this is so good\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-10-15 14:38:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Updating my review to inform readers that I have returned here now at least 4 more times and sometimes my food has been less than great. Also, the last 3 times they didn't have any ribs. I also think that the quality of food you get depends on who's working. I will try again but if they give me stories and crappy food I will not go back ever again.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Kaptain's Firehouse BBQ, located at 6543 Pardall Rd, Isla Vista, CA, is a local restaurant offering food delivery services. They specialize in American and Barbeque cuisines, including chicken wings and sandwiches. The restaurant operates from 11:30 to 21:30 every day. While they don't offer WiFi or reservations, they do feature outdoor seating and takeout services. However, the place may not be suitable for groups. Street parking is available, and the ambience is casual. The business has a 3.5-star rating. While some customers have praised their mac n cheese, pulled pork, bbq sauce, and tater tots, others have noted inconsistent quality of food and service, including a lack of ribs and poor customer service.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
