A\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Comedy Hideaway is a popular nightlife spot in Santa Barbara, California, renowned for performing arts, comedy clubs, and event planning. The club is open on Tuesdays, Fridays, and Saturdays, and offers ample lot parking but doesn't provide WiFi or outdoor seating. The ambience is intimate and casual, making it suitable for group outings. According to customer reviews, the club is recognized for featuring rising talent and hosting enjoyable shows with affordable drinks. One reviewer lauded a performance by Laurie Kilmartin, while another appreciated the good food and fun atmosphere, albeit remarking on the seating. Currently, the club has an average rating of 4.5 stars. There are plans to move the establishment to a larger location in downtown Santa Barbara.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
