1.32.380.718 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"Buzz has surrounded HBO's new documentary \\\"Going Clear: Scientology and the Prison of Belief,\\\" but Scientologist John Travolta is not a fan. Travolta told the Tampa Bay Times that he has not seen the documentary, \\\"and I don't really care to.\\\" \\\"I've been so happy with my (Scientology) experience in the last 40 years that I really don't have anything to say that would shed light on (a documentary) so decidedly negative,\\\" Travolta said. The actor, one of the Church of Scientology's most high-profile members along with stars like Tom Cruise and Kirstie Alley, is premiering his new film, \\\"The Forger,\\\" in Clearwater, Florida. The HBO documentary is based on the book \\\"Going Clear: Scientology, Hollywood, and the Prison of Belief\\\" by Lawrence Wright and is critical of the organization, which has close ties to the showbiz industry. Travolta said he believed the doc was a result of \\\"people who were disgruntled with their experiences\\\" with the Church of Scientology, which he touted as a positive experience for him. \\\"I haven't experienced anything that the hearsay has (claimed), so why would I communicate something that wasn't true for me?\\\" Travolta asked. \\\"It wouldn't make sense, nor would it for Tom (Cruise), I imagine.\\\" He called Scientology \\\"brilliant\\\" and credited the church with helping him to survive the death of his teen son, Jett, after a seizure while the family was on vacation in the Bahamas in 2009. \\\"Oh, my God, I wouldn't have made it,\\\" said Travolta, whose wife, Kelly Preston, is also a member. \\\"Honestly.\\\"\\n\", \"original_answer\": \"HBO's documentary \\\"Going Clear: Scientology and the Prison of Belief\\\" has received buzz, but John Travolta, a high-profile Scientologist, is not interested in seeing it. Travolta believes the documentary is based on \\\"disgruntled\\\" individuals and that he has had positive experiences with the Church of Scientology. He calls Scientology \\\"brilliant\\\" and credits the church with helping him cope with the death of his son.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
