p music, but it was noted that she still has a significant impact on the country genre. Overall, the 50th ACM Awards had its ups and downs, but it was a memorable and significant milestone for the country music community.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [], \"source_evidence_erased\": true}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
