1.47.979.974 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"model": "unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"5575 Hollister Ave\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mediterranean, Restaurants, Greek\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Goleta\\\",\\\"hours\\\":null,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mediterra Market and Cafe\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-08-19 18:52:35\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I love this place.  Customer Service is excellent, everything out of the kitchen looks and tastes homemade.  Very cool, european atmosphere indoors.  Outdoors is really just the parking lot but the owners are very accommodating.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-07-19 19:19:22\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"i got the combo plate and it was not a very good value. the food is decent, but they are very stingy with their meat on this plate. its ok if youre really craving mediterra